{
  "v": 6,
  "id": "0ed0f79d-27ad-4234-b1cb-951a3d64e60e",
  "title": "2. 과업 관리 방안 — 규정 개정 지원",
  "canvas": {
    "w": 1280,
    "h": 905
  },
  "source": {
    "kind": "kg-html",
    "html": "<section class=\"kg-slide kg-root\" data-screen-label=\"규정 개정 지원형\">\n  <header class=\"kg-header\">\n    <div class=\"kg-header__media\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__num kg-section-num\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__divider\"></div>\n    <div class=\"kg-header__titles\">\n      <div class=\"kg-section-title\">과업 관리 방안</div>\n      <div class=\"kg-section-sub\">규정 개정 지원</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"kg-chapter-tab\">\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__roman\">III</span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tab__sep\"></span>\n      <span class=\"kg-chapter-tag\">과업 품질 관리</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"kg-msgband\"><span class=\"kg-msgband__mark\"></span>\n    <p class=\"kg-message\">전략체계·조직진단 결과와 어긋나는 내부 규정을 폭넓게 검토하고 제·개정 방향을 제언</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"kg-body-area\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n\n      <div class=\"top\">\n        <span class=\"top__t\" data-kg-role=\"h1\">중장기 발전계획 개편 및 조직진단 기반 규정 통합 개정·재정비 지원</span>\n        <span class=\"stamp\" data-kg-role=\"label\">Illustrative</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"cols\">\n\n        <!-- 1 -->\n        <div class=\"cl\">\n          <div class=\"chd\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">제 규정 현황 검토</div>\n          <div class=\"fig\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n              <rect x=\"12\" y=\"2\" width=\"176\" height=\"296\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n              <rect x=\"66\" y=\"8\" width=\"68\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--ink-navy)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"100\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">직제규정</text>\n\n              <g font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <text x=\"100\" y=\"36\">제1장 총칙</text>\n                <text x=\"100\" y=\"132\">제2장 본부 및 부서</text>\n                <text x=\"100\" y=\"212\">제3장 위원회 및 협의체</text>\n                <text x=\"100\" y=\"276\">부칙</text>\n              </g>\n              <g font-size=\"7\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-700)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"47\">제1조 (목적)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"64\">제2조 (적용범위)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"81\">제3조 (용어의 정의)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"98\">제4조 (조직의 구성)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"115\">제5조 (사무의 분장)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"143\">제6조 (본부의 설치)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"160\">제7조 (부서의 설치·폐지)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"177\">제8조 (정원의 관리)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"194\">제9조 (직무대행)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"223\">제10조 (위원회 설치)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"240\">제11조 (운영 및 소집)</text>\n                <text x=\"20\" y=\"257\">제12조 (간사 및 사무)</text>\n              </g>\n              <g fill=\"var(--neutral-200)\">\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"56\" width=\"132\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"67\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"73\" width=\"118\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"84\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"90\" width=\"146\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"101\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"107\" width=\"104\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"118\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"124\" width=\"138\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"146\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"152\" width=\"126\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"163\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"169\" width=\"142\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"180\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"186\" width=\"110\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"197\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"203\" width=\"134\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"226\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"232\" width=\"122\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"243\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"249\" width=\"148\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"260\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"266\" width=\"98\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"20\" y=\"281\" width=\"160\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"20\" y=\"287\" width=\"128\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n              </g>\n              <text x=\"100\" y=\"296\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"6\" fill=\"var(--ink-500)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">- 1 -</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"bl\">\n            <span class=\"b1\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">규정 점검표를 활용하여 직제·사업관리·성과관리·예산 등 내부 규정 전반의 정합성 검토</span>\n            <span class=\"b2\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">전략체계·조직진단 결과와 어긋나는 조항을 가려내어 개선 대상 규정 확정</span>\n          </div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 2 -->\n        <div class=\"cl\">\n          <div class=\"chd chd--mid\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">리스크 도출</div>\n          <div class=\"fig\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n              <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"196\" height=\"296\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n              <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"196\" height=\"15\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\"></rect>\n              <g font-size=\"7\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <text x=\"28\" y=\"12\">규정 영역</text><text x=\"84\" y=\"12\">현행 조항</text>\n                <text x=\"128\" y=\"12\">리스크</text><text x=\"174\" y=\"12\">개선 방향</text>\n              </g>\n              <g stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\">\n                <path d=\"M54 17 V298\"></path><path d=\"M114 17 V298\"></path><path d=\"M148 17 V298\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M2 42 H198\"></path><path d=\"M2 67 H198\"></path><path d=\"M2 92 H198\"></path><path d=\"M2 117 H198\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M2 142 H198\"></path><path d=\"M2 167 H198\"></path><path d=\"M2 192 H198\"></path><path d=\"M2 217 H198\"></path>\n                <path d=\"M2 242 H198\"></path><path d=\"M2 267 H198\"></path>\n              </g>\n              <g font-size=\"7\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <text x=\"6\" y=\"32\">직제·조직</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"57\">사업관리</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"82\">성과관리</text>\n                <text x=\"6\" y=\"107\">위임전결</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"132\">이사회 운영</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"157\">예산·회계</text>\n                <text x=\"6\" y=\"182\">인사·정원</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"207\">이해관계자</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"232\">정보공개</text>\n                <text x=\"6\" y=\"257\">안전·윤리</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"282\">기타 준용</text>\n              </g>\n              <g fill=\"var(--neutral-200)\">\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"24\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"30\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"36\" width=\"48\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"49\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"55\" width=\"38\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"61\" width=\"46\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"74\" width=\"48\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"80\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"86\" width=\"34\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"99\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"105\" width=\"44\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"111\" width=\"50\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"124\" width=\"46\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"130\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"136\" width=\"40\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"149\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"155\" width=\"36\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"161\" width=\"48\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"174\" width=\"50\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"180\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"186\" width=\"32\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"199\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"205\" width=\"40\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"211\" width=\"46\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"224\" width=\"44\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"230\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"236\" width=\"38\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"249\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"255\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"261\" width=\"48\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"58\" y=\"274\" width=\"48\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"280\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"58\" y=\"286\" width=\"36\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"26\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"32\" width=\"34\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"51\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"57\" width=\"28\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"76\" width=\"38\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"82\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"101\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"107\" width=\"32\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"126\" width=\"36\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"132\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"151\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"157\" width=\"30\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"176\" width=\"40\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"182\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"201\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"207\" width=\"26\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"226\" width=\"34\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"232\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"251\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"257\" width=\"36\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"152\" y=\"276\" width=\"38\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"152\" y=\"282\" width=\"42\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n              </g>\n              <g font-size=\"6.5\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"24\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--red-050)\" stroke=\"var(--red-500)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"32\" fill=\"var(--red-600)\">높음</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"49\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--red-050)\" stroke=\"var(--red-500)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"57\" fill=\"var(--red-600)\">높음</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"74\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--red-050)\" stroke=\"var(--red-500)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"82\" fill=\"var(--red-600)\">높음</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"99\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"107\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">보통</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"124\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"132\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">보통</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"149\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"157\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">보통</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"174\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--red-050)\" stroke=\"var(--red-500)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"182\" fill=\"var(--red-600)\">높음</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"199\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"207\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">보통</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"224\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--neutral-100)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"232\" fill=\"var(--ink-700)\">낮음</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"249\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"257\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\">보통</text>\n                <rect x=\"118\" y=\"274\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--neutral-100)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect><text x=\"131\" y=\"282\" fill=\"var(--ink-700)\">낮음</text>\n              </g>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"bl\">\n            <span class=\"b1\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">규정 간 상충·공백과 상위 법령 저촉 가능성을 파악하여 리스크를 심층 검토·판단</span>\n            <span class=\"b2\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">그 결과에 따라 제·개정할 규정과 조항을 명확히 구분</span>\n          </div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 3 -->\n        <div class=\"cl\">\n          <div class=\"chd chd--mid\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">개선방안 수립</div>\n          <div class=\"fig\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n              <rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"196\" height=\"296\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n              <g fill=\"var(--neutral-050)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\">\n                <rect x=\"6\" y=\"8\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"70\" y=\"8\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"134\" y=\"8\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n              </g>\n              <g font-size=\"7\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <text x=\"36\" y=\"20\">관련 법령·지침</text><text x=\"36\" y=\"31\">해석</text>\n                <text x=\"100\" y=\"20\">유사기관</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"31\">규정 비교</text>\n                <text x=\"164\" y=\"20\">조직진단</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"31\">전략체계</text>\n              </g>\n              <g stroke=\"var(--blue-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M36 38 V48\"></path><path d=\"M100 38 V48\"></path><path d=\"M164 38 V48\"></path>\n              </g>\n              <g fill=\"var(--blue-500)\">\n                <path d=\"M32 46 L36 54 L40 46 z\"></path><path d=\"M96 46 L100 54 L104 46 z\"></path><path d=\"M160 46 L164 54 L168 46 z\"></path>\n              </g>\n\n              <rect x=\"6\" y=\"58\" width=\"188\" height=\"150\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect>\n              <rect x=\"6\" y=\"58\" width=\"188\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"100\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">규정 제·개정 지침 도출</text>\n              <g fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-300)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\">\n                <rect x=\"12\" y=\"82\" width=\"176\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"12\" y=\"107\" width=\"176\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"12\" y=\"132\" width=\"176\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"12\" y=\"157\" width=\"176\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"12\" y=\"182\" width=\"176\" height=\"21\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n              </g>\n              <g font-size=\"7\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--blue-500)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <text x=\"17\" y=\"96\">1</text><text x=\"17\" y=\"121\">2</text><text x=\"17\" y=\"146\">3</text>\n                <text x=\"17\" y=\"171\">4</text><text x=\"17\" y=\"196\">5</text>\n              </g>\n              <g font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <text x=\"26\" y=\"93\">주요 사례 반영</text>\n                <text x=\"26\" y=\"118\">정부 정책·경영평가 기준 반영</text>\n                <text x=\"26\" y=\"143\">유사기관 운영 사례 참조</text>\n                <text x=\"26\" y=\"168\">전략체계·조직진단과 정합 확인</text>\n                <text x=\"26\" y=\"193\">이해관계자 의견 수렴</text>\n              </g>\n              <g fill=\"var(--neutral-200)\">\n                <rect x=\"26\" y=\"97\" width=\"120\" height=\"2.5\" rx=\"1.2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"26\" y=\"122\" width=\"140\" height=\"2.5\" rx=\"1.2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"26\" y=\"147\" width=\"112\" height=\"2.5\" rx=\"1.2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"26\" y=\"172\" width=\"134\" height=\"2.5\" rx=\"1.2\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"26\" y=\"197\" width=\"106\" height=\"2.5\" rx=\"1.2\"></rect>\n              </g>\n\n              <g stroke=\"var(--blue-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M100 208 V220\"></path></g>\n              <path d=\"M96 218 L100 226 L104 218 z\" fill=\"var(--blue-500)\"></path>\n\n              <rect x=\"6\" y=\"230\" width=\"188\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--red-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"100\" y=\"247\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--red-600)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">제·개정 지침 확정안 작성</text>\n\n              <g fill=\"var(--neutral-200)\">\n                <rect x=\"6\" y=\"266\" width=\"188\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"6\" y=\"274\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"6\" y=\"282\" width=\"176\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"6\" y=\"290\" width=\"128\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n              </g>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"bl\">\n            <span class=\"b1\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">관련 법령·지침 해석과 유사기관 규정을 검토하여 상충을 줄이는 제·개정 지침 작성</span>\n            <span class=\"b2\" data-kg-role=\"caption\">전담조직(TFT)·소관 부서와 협의해 개선방안의 적정성을 검토하고 확정안 초안 작성</span>\n          </div></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 4 -->\n        <div class=\"cl\">\n          <div class=\"chd\" data-kg-role=\"h2\">규정 제·개정 확정</div>\n          <div class=\"fig\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n              <rect x=\"4\" y=\"16\" width=\"150\" height=\"282\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--neutral-050)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n              <rect x=\"14\" y=\"10\" width=\"164\" height=\"286\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FAFBFC\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n              <rect x=\"28\" y=\"4\" width=\"168\" height=\"290\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" stroke=\"var(--neutral-300)\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"112\" y=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">규정 제·개정 확정안</text>\n              <path d=\"M38 23 H186\" stroke=\"var(--ink-navy)\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"></path>\n              <g font-size=\"7\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--ink-navy)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">\n                <text x=\"34\" y=\"36\">1. 직제규정 개정안</text>\n                <text x=\"34\" y=\"82\">2. 사업관리규정 개정안</text>\n                <text x=\"34\" y=\"128\">3. 성과관리규정 신설안</text>\n                <text x=\"34\" y=\"174\">4. 위임전결규정 개정안</text>\n                <text x=\"34\" y=\"212\">5. 이사회운영규정 개정안</text>\n              </g>\n              <g fill=\"var(--neutral-200)\">\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"41\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"47\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"53\" width=\"122\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"59\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"65\" width=\"104\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"71\" width=\"138\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"87\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"93\" width=\"134\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"99\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"105\" width=\"96\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"111\" width=\"146\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"117\" width=\"118\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"133\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"139\" width=\"126\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"145\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"151\" width=\"110\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"157\" width=\"142\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"163\" width=\"88\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"179\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"185\" width=\"130\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"191\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"197\" width=\"102\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"217\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"223\" width=\"140\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"229\" width=\"116\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n              </g>\n              <rect x=\"34\" y=\"242\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"var(--blue-050)\" stroke=\"var(--blue-400)\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></rect>\n              <text x=\"109\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--navy-800)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">전문가 검토 의견 반영</text>\n              <g fill=\"var(--neutral-200)\">\n                <rect x=\"34\" y=\"270\" width=\"150\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect><rect x=\"34\" y=\"276\" width=\"112\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\"></rect>\n              </g>\n              <circle cx=\"158\" cy=\"278\" r=\"15\" fill=\"var(--paper)\" opacity=\"0.9\"></circle>\n              <circle cx=\"158\" cy=\"278\" r=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--red-500)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></circle>\n              <text x=\"158\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"7\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--red-600)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">최종</text>\n              <text x=\"158\" y=\"285\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"7\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"var(--red-600)\" font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\">확정</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cell\"><div class=\"bl\">\n            <span class=\"b1\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">개선방안에 따른 직제·사업관리·성과관리 등 관련 규정의 잠정 제·개정안 작성</span>\n            <span class=\"b1\" data-kg-role=\"body3\">전문가 검토와 이사회 보고를 거쳐 최종 제·개정안 확정</span>\n          </div></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"kg-footer\">\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__src\">JDC 중장기 경영전략체계 진단 및 수립 — 조직진단 연계 규정 제·개정 지원 절차</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__page\">48</span>\n    <span class=\"kg-footer__logo\"><img src=\"/kg/assets/keynes-group-logo.png\" alt=\"Keynes Group\"></span>\n  </footer>\n</section>",
    "css": ".wrap{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;}\n\n  .top{flex:0 0 auto;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    padding-bottom:7px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--neutral-300);}\n  .top__t{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink-navy);}\n  .stamp{position:absolute;right:0;top:-2px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;font-style:italic;\n    color:var(--red-600);border:1.5px solid var(--red-500);border-radius:2px;padding:2px 9px;}\n\n  .cols{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;min-height:0;}\n  .cl{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;gap:8px;}\n  .cl:not(:last-child)::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:16px;right:-14px;\n    width:0;height:0;border-top:7px solid transparent;border-bottom:7px solid transparent;\n    border-left:10px solid var(--blue-500);}\n\n  .chd{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2C5184,#1F497D);color:#fff;\n    font-size:15px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;padding:8px 22px 8px 12px;border-radius:3px;\n    clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 15px) 0,100% 50%,calc(100% - 15px) 100%,0 100%);}\n  .chd--mid{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5A86BE,#4F81BD);}\n\n  .fig{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    border:1px solid var(--neutral-300);border-radius:3px;background:var(--neutral-050);padding:5px;}\n  .fig svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;}\n\n  .cell{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;}\n  .bl{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;}\n  .b1{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.26;color:var(--ink-900);}\n  .b1::before{content:\"\";flex:0 0 auto;width:5px;height:5px;margin-top:6px;\n    background:var(--navy-800);border-radius:1px;}\n  .b2{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:7px;margin-left:12px;\n    font-size:13px;line-height:1.24;color:var(--ink-700);}\n  .b2::before{content:\"–\";flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:800;color:var(--gray-400);line-height:1.24;}",
